.alert.alert-light.border
  %h3.fw-semibold.mb-2 Goal of this page
  %p.mb-3
    Scan who has signed their true job description recently enough, and who still needs to — across the people you can see.

  %h3.fw-semibold.mb-2 Context
  %p.mb-3
    Employees sign their true JD after a manager-finalized position check-in or a position change. One signature after the latest trigger clears both, and is due within 30 days of that trigger.

  %h3.fw-semibold.mb-2 Specifics of this page
  %ul.mb-0
    %li
      %strong Beta.
      JD-sign hygiene first; more expectation signals may join later.
    %li Who to show uses the same scope options as other health pages (everyone / hierarchy / manager / just me).
    %li Status uses the same compliance rules as the teammate’s signed True JD page.
    %li
      Open
      %em Signed JD
      to review past signatures or sign again.
